<title>USA: Colonel's Intl Inc posts Q3 profits.</title>
<headline>Colonel's Intl Inc posts Q3 profits.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonel's International Inc, a subsidiary of Brainerd International Raceway Inc, said it closed its third quarter with profits of $317,000 on gross revenues exceeding $2.5 million.</p>
<p>Colonel's merged with Brainerd International Raceway on December  31, 1995. As a result, year-ago comparative figures are not meaningful, the company said.</p>
<p>The multi-purpose race track in Brainerd, Minn. operates from May through October.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
